; Camera relocalization - obstructed. As standard, plus an obstacle group placed on the eroded shortest path so that the
; shortest path changes; the obstacle must be in the head camera's view at some point along the new path; the new path
; must stay inside the instance's length bucket. Never manipulated. One obstacle for now: the group size is a customs
; list parameter (generation.groups.obstacles.size = 1), the candidate categories come from roles/candidates.csv.
(define (iddl camera_relocalization-obstructed)
    (:family camera_relocalization)
    (:alias camera_relocalization-obstructed-{obstacles})
    (:init
        (ontop obstacles floor)
        (ontop agent floor)
    )
    (:goal
        (and
            (pose_reached ?agent)
            (pose_settled ?agent)
        )
    )
)
